{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile setting with avgpool aggregation, isolating its performance in this context. The validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275 suggest it outperforms the singleprofile RNA-only baseline (config_003) but remains lower than multimodal multiprofile models (e.g., config_006). Uncertainty persists about whether the improvement stems from the multiprofile setting itself or the encoder's capabilities, and whether other RNA encoders could achieve similar results."
}

